<Base title="About" description="About Zentra Daily — how we report, what we publish, and how to contact us.">
  <div class="article about">
    <h1>About Zentra Daily</h1>
    <p><b>Zentra Daily</b> — world news, sports, entertainment, AI &amp; learning, clearly explained. We cover the world, politics, business and the economy, technology and AI, science and the environment, society, entertainment, sports, students, learning, health and culture.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;margin:24px 0 10px">How we report</h2>
    <p>Every article on Zentra Daily is based on reporting from a named, credible source, and every article carries a Sources section linking to it. We do not invent quotes, figures or events. Where a fact is still unconfirmed — an investigation in progress, a motive not yet established, a market prediction rather than a result — we say so in the article.</p>
    <p>Articles are researched and checked before publication. Nothing on this site is auto-published.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;margin:24px 0 10px">Images</h2>
    <p>We do not present any image as a real photograph of a real event unless it is one. Illustrations on this site are clearly labelled "Illustration". Real news photographs belong to their copyright holders and are not reused here as our own.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:900;margin:24px 0 10px">Corrections</h2>
    <p>If you spot an error, tell us and we will correct it and note the correction. Getting it right matters more than getting it first.</p>
    <p>Zentra Daily is an independent news site. It is not affiliated with any government, political party or the publications it cites as sources.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
